# Static response headers — copied verbatim by adapter-cloudflare into the
# worker output, merged with SvelteKit's auto-generated immutable-asset
# section. Edit here; rebuild to ship.
#
# Cross-origin isolation: COOP=same-origin + COEP=require-corp lets us use
# SharedArrayBuffer / OPFS / threaded WASM in the browser (sqlocal, future
# audio/perf features). Applied to every route — it's a page-level setting,
# not API-specific — and harmless on routes that don't need it.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
